<DentaCaseLayout title="Denta — Meta Ads" description="How paid social became a second patient acquisition engine for Denta." eyebrow="META ADS" headline="Search captures demand." accent="Meta creates it." intro="Google reaches people already looking. Meta gives the clinic another way to reach potential patients before they type a treatment into search." metrics={[{value:'1,639',label:'Meta enquiries / 2025'},{value:'€7.35',label:'weighted CPL / 2025'},{value:'1,902',label:'Meta enquiries / Jan–Aug 2026'},{value:'€6.10',label:'weighted CPL / Jan–Aug 2026'}]}>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">THE ROLE</span><div><h2>A second engine<br/>for acquisition.</h2><p class="statement">Paid social should not imitate Google Search. It solves a different problem.</p><p>Instead of waiting for explicit search intent, Meta campaigns put relevant offers and clinic services in front of potential patients and convert response into measurable enquiries.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="accent-section"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">2025 → 2026</span><h2>More enquiries.<br/>Lower weighted CPL.</h2><div class="data-list"><div class="data-row"><span>2025</span><span>1,639 Meta enquiries</span><strong>€7.35 CPL</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>JAN–AUG 2026</span><span>1,902 Meta enquiries</span><strong>€6.10 CPL</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section dark"><div class="shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">CHANNEL DESIGN</span><div><h2>Different intent.<br/>Same business outcome.</h2><p class="statement">Meta and Google were measured separately, but they were built to contribute to the same clinic acquisition system.</p><div class="flow"><span>CREATIVE / OFFER</span><b>→</b><span>META</span><b>→</b><span>PATIENT RESPONSE</span><b>→</b><span>ENQUIRY</span></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT CHANGED</span><div><h2>Paid social became<br/>material at scale.</h2><p>In only the first eight reported months of 2026, Meta generated 1,902 enquiries — already above the 1,639 recorded for the whole of 2025.</p><p class="statement">That is why we treat Meta as an acquisition product, not a content distribution budget.</p></div></div></section>
</DentaCaseLayout>